Package: Friedman
Title: Simple Helpers for Library Data
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: person("Michael", "Holstein", email = "mikeh143@yahoo.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A small package of helper functions for common library and information science data tasks. It is meant for students who need quick summaries and simple plots without writing the same code over and over.
Depends: R (>= 3.1.2)
Imports: ggplot2, dplyr
License: CC0
LazyData: true
